riscvprog.py
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
host/riscvprog.py (HKSPI / AD5664RBitBang / Config) derives from the
Caravel/Efabless `riscvprog` / housekeeping-SPI tooling lineage. Its upstream
license could not be pinned to a single file at release time; treat it as
Apache-2.0 consistent with the rest of the Caravel tooling, and verify the
upstream text before any redistribution that changes this notice.

